# Optional. EfreeLib searches Google Books first and falls back to Open Library, so it works
# without a key. Without one, Google Books shares a small anonymous quota with everyone and
# it is often used up for the day. A free key gives you your own quota (1,000 requests a day).
#
# 1. Open https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/books.googleapis.com and enable the
#    Books API for a project.
# 2. Open Credentials, create an API key, and under API restrictions limit it to the Books API.
# 3. Copy this file to .env (it is git-ignored), paste the key below and restart `npm run dev`.
VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=
